          "sense_id": "sense:mrj:maarij:flame",
          "definition": "A mingled flame or fire, also explained as fire without smoke.",
          "usage_conditions": "In the Quranic phrase مِنْ مَارِجٍ مِنْ نَارٍ, the term describes a flame or fire characterized as a mixture.",
          "source_refs": [
            "lane:entry:12481",
